[ti:Danny Boy]
[ar:Traditional]
[00:00.00]Oh Danny boy, the pipes, the pipes are calling
[00:17.30]From glen to glen, and down the mountain side
[00:20.02]The summer's gone, and all the roses falling
[00:27.46]It's you, it's you must go and I must bide
[00:35.70]But come ye back when summer's in the meadow
[00:49.30]Or when the valley's hushed and white with snow
[00:57.30]It's I'll be here in sunshine or in shadow
[01:06.42]Oh Danny boy, oh Danny boy, I love you so
